  "en": "Touya: Seven. Second grade.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 1319,
  "text_len": 23
 },
 {
  "id": "sce394:00554",
  "jp": "アイ「よく覚えてるね。{nl}　あたしなんかその時なにしてたか覚えてないよ？」",
  "off": 1364,
  "len": 43,
  "en": "",
  "status": "todo",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 1366,
  "text_len": 40
 },
 {
  "id": "sce394:00582",
  "jp": "トウヤ「あの時、なかなか馴染めずにクラスで{nl}　孤立していたからよく覚えてんだ。{nl}　その時に話かけてきたのがあいつだった」",
  "off": 1410,
  "len": 71,
  "en": "Touya: Back then I couldn't fit in and was on my own in class, so it stuck with me. She was the one who came and talked to me.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 1412,
  "text_len": 68
 },
 {
  "id": "sce394:005DE",
  "jp": "アイ「へぇ‥‥勇気あるんだ。{nl}　その頃ってそういうことしたら一緒に無視されたり、{nl}　いじめられたりするでしょ？」",
  "off": 1502,
  "len": 69,
  "en": "Ai: Huh... that took guts. At that age, if you did something like that, you'd get ignored right along with them, or bullied, right?",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 1504,
  "text_len": 66
 },
 {
  "id": "sce394:00626",
  "jp": "トウヤ「ああ。だけどあいつはそんなことおかまいなしで{nl}　接してきた。ほっとけなかったんだとさ」",
  "off": 1574,
  "len": 51,
  "en": "Touya: Yeah. But she didn't care about any of that and came at me anyway. Said she couldn't just leave me be.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 1576,
  "text_len": 48
 },
 {
  "id": "sce394:00660",
  "jp": "アイ「優しいんだ」",
  "off": 1632,
  "len": 13,
  "en": "Ai: She's sweet.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 1634,
  "text_len": 10
 },
 {
  "id": "sce394:00670",
  "jp": "トウヤ「お人好しなんだよ。{nl}　まぁ、ガキ同士のことだし、陰湿ないじめとかもなく、{nl}　すぐにあいつを通してクラスに溶け込めた。{nl}　で、家も隣同士ってこともあってそれからの{nl}　付き合いだな。{nl}　まぁ、途中で会わなくなることもあったけど‥‥」",
  "off": 1648,
  "len": 141,
  "en": "",
  "status": "todo",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 1650,
  "text_len": 138
 },
 {
  "id": "sce394:00704",
  "jp": "アイ「冷やかされたからでしょ？」",
  "off": 1796,
  "len": 21,
  "en": "Ai: Because people teased you, right?",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 1798,
  "text_len": 18
 },
 {
  "id": "sce394:0071C",
