  "off": 1820,
  "len": 21,
  "en": "Touya: Wh-how'd you know?",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 1822,
  "text_len": 18
 },
 {
  "id": "sce394:00738",
  "jp": "アイ「パターンよねぇ‥‥いつも一緒に登下校して、{nl}　それまで当たり前で気にもとめてなかったのに、{nl}　クラスメイトに冷やかされて妙に意識してしまった」",
  "off": 1848,
  "len": 92,
  "en": "Ai: It's the classic pattern... You always walked to and from school together, it was normal and you never gave it a thought, then your classmates teased you and suddenly you got all self-conscious.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 1850,
  "text_len": 89
 },
 {
  "id": "sce394:00797",
  "jp": "トウヤ「うっ‥‥」",
  "off": 1943,
  "len": 14,
  "en": "Touya: Ugh...",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 1945,
  "text_len": 11
 },
 {
  "id": "sce394:007B3",
  "jp": "アイ「会わなくなった原因はあんたが避けたから。{nl}　そうでしょ？」",
  "off": 1971,
  "len": 40,
  "en": "Ai: And you stopped seeing each other because you avoided her. Right?",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 1973,
  "text_len": 37
 },
 {
  "id": "sce394:007DE",
  "jp": "トウヤ「‥‥ああ。クラスもかわったこともあったし。{nl}　それで、中学に入ってまた同じクラスになるまでな」",
  "off": 2014,
  "len": 60,
  "en": "Touya: ...Yeah. We'd ended up in different classes too. Until we landed in the same class again in junior high.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
