  "en": "Touya: Oh, r-right...",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 2374,
  "text_len": 13
 },
 {
  "id": "sce394:00957",
  "jp": "ヤマト「生まれて間もニャいあたしをトウヤが{nl}　拾ってくれて、それからずっと一緒だもんね」",
  "off": 2391,
  "len": 52,
  "en": "Yamato: You picked me up when I was a nyewborn, Touya, and we've been together ever since.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 2393,
  "text_len": 49
 },
 {
  "id": "sce394:0098E",
  "jp": "トウヤ「同じ独りだったからな。{nl}　お前やカスミが居てくれたから、自暴自棄にならずに{nl}　すんだのかもな」",
  "off": 2446,
  "len": 62,
  "en": "Touya: We were both alone. Maybe it's thanks to you and Kasumi being around that I didn't go off the deep end.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 2448,
  "text_len": 59
 },
 {
  "id": "sce394:009CF",
  "jp": "ヤマト「ニャによあらたまって、照れるじゃニャい」",
  "off": 2511,
  "len": 28,
  "en": "Yamato: Nyow what's with getting all sentimental? You're embarrassing me, nya.",
