  "len": 14,
  "en": "Ai: I see...",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 2548,
  "text_len": 11
 },
 {
  "id": "sce394:00A03",
  "jp": "トウヤ「そういえばカスミの奴がそれまで以上に世話を{nl}　焼くようになったのって、その頃からだな‥‥」",
  "off": 2563,
  "len": 61,
  "en": "Touya: Come to think of it, that's about when Kasumi started fussing over me even more than before...",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 2565,
  "text_len": 58
 },
 {
  "id": "sce394:00A4E",
  "jp": "アイ「ますます強敵ね‥‥」",
  "off": 2638,
  "len": 20,
  "en": "Ai: She's an even tougher rival than I thought...",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 2640,
  "text_len": 17
 },
